    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 5 · 2:06 to 3:36 · the long one</span>
      <strong>The sliding-block board of smiley faces</strong>
      This is the level's time sink. A full-screen frame of coloured square blocks, each with a face, shuffled around one gap. The recording grinds on it for a minute and a half with the room clock running, which is the honest signal for how fiddly it is. We are not printing a move list: the footage is cut and the block layout changes between sampled seconds, so a guessed sequence would cost you more time than working it out yourself.
