      <div class="ts">Watch: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VMJIdMH_xxI&t=420s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">7:00</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 13 · 7:27 to 7:45 · the sweep</span>
      <strong>Paper, tape, scissors and a windmill</strong>
      The camera drops back to the room and the next twenty seconds are housekeeping. At 7:27 a <b>yellow triangular puzzle piece</b> gets its own close-up — one of the loose pieces the tangram board takes. At 7:41 the shelf above the dresser gets inspected: a small white wooden <b>windmill</b> model, a letter <b>a</b> block and a floral card. At 7:43 the inventory lists <b>Pieces of paper</b>, <b>Adhesive tape</b> and <b>Scissors</b> — the paper stack is what the tape and scissors exist for, so expect a combine step rather than a code.
