      <div class="ts">Watch: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VMJIdMH_xxI&t=476s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">7:56</a> · <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VMJIdMH_xxI&t=501s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">8:21</a></div>
    </div>

