      <span class="step-num">Step 16 · 8:32 to 8:40 · the tangram pays out</span>
      <strong>The fish board hands over a key</strong>
      The tangram board from 3:42 comes back at 8:32, and this time the triangular pieces are actually going into the fish outline. By 8:37 the shape is nearly filled and a small <b>silver key</b> is lying among the pieces — the board's reward, not a separate pickup. At 8:40 the key is in the inventory. If you were stuck on the tangram earlier, the missing pieces are the ones the cabinet at 8:21 hands you: the <b>green triangle</b> at 8:22 and the <b>pale-blue piece</b> at 8:26, plus the yellow triangle from 7:27.
