      <div class="ts">Watch: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VMJIdMH_xxI&t=512s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">8:32</a> · <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VMJIdMH_xxI&t=519s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">8:39</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 17 · 8:41 to 8:43 · the exit</span>
      <strong>The exit arrow, and the ending the video does not show</strong>
      At 8:41 the inventory is open with the <b>Key</b> selected. One second later the camera is back on the room and the orange <b>exit arrow</b> is floating over the door on the left wall — the room's own signal that it is finished. Then the frame fades to black at <b>8:43</b>. The door never opens on camera: there is no door animation, no results card, no star rating and no payout. The coin counter reads <b>3,340</b> at 0:05 and still <b>3,340</b> at 8:42, so this page prints no reward figure for Kids Bedroom 1.
